/-!
# Global positive smooth Type III convolution discrepancy

The actual positive compact profile sequences, finite convolution, coherent
primitive residue, and full finite set of dense squarefree moduli are retained
from the public source. The new local Fourier input is explicit; sampling,
fine-band covering, divisor growth, and every analytic saving are proved.
Generated by scripts/build_type_iii_positive_global.py.
-/

